abstract: >-
  Monthly aggregate snapshot of live US data center job postings on Data Center
  JobHub: live jobs by state, role family and employer, plus median advertised
  pay ranges from employer-stated listings. Frozen at a recorded UTC cutoff per
  edition; methodology and the current edition at the series page.
